{
 "sections": [
  {
   "title": "Act 10: October 2026",
   "beats": [
    {
     "id": "s11b01",
     "shot": "mid_sept",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "It began in mid-September, with two things happening at once.",
     "date": null,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "ding",
       "w:mid-September,",
       0.4
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s11b02",
     "shot": "port_blockade",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "On the south coast, fishermen blockaded the port of Nice and a fuel depot",
     "date": 2026,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "pop2",
       "w:Nice",
       0.4
      ]
     ],
     "amb": "waves"
    },
    {
     "id": "s11b03",
     "shot": "port_blockade",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "near Sete, furious about the price of diesel.",
     "date": 2026,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "pop2",
       "w:Sete,",
       0.4
      ],
      [
       "riser",
       "w:diesel.",
       0.4
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s11b04",
     "shot": "school_block",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "And in the suburbs of Paris and other cities,",
     "date": 2026,
     "sfx": []
    },
    {
     "id": "s11b05",
     "shot": "school_block",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "high school students started blockading their own schools,",
     "date": 2026,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "slam",
       "w:blockading",
       0.4
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s11b06",
     "shot": "school_block",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "over teacher shortages, overcrowded classes and buildings that can't cope with the heat.",
     "date": 2026,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "stamp",
       "w:teacher",
       0.3
      ],
      [
       "stamp",
       "w:overcrowded",
       0.3
      ],
      [
       "stamp",
       "w:heat.",
       0.3
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s11b07",
     "shot": "school_block",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "By early October, one analysis counted more than 700 secondary schools disrupted.",
     "date": 2026,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "ticks",
       "w:700",
       0.4
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s11b08",
     "shot": "march7",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "On 7 October, around a quarter of a million people marched.",
     "date": 2026,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "drum",
       4,
       0.4
      ],
      [
       "ticks",
       "w:quarter",
       0.3
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s11b09",
     "shot": "why_schools",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "Why schools?",
     "date": null,
     "sfx": []
    },
    {
     "id": "s11b10",
     "shot": "classroom",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "One union survey of more than a thousand schools found that at the start",
     "date": 2026,
     "sfx": []
    },
    {
     "id": "s11b11",
     "shot": "classroom",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "of the year, 53 percent of secondary schools were missing at least one teacher.",
     "date": 2026,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "impact",
       "w:53",
       0.5
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s11b12",
     "shot": "classroom",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "Reports describe classes of 35 or even 40 students.",
     "date": 2026,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "pops",
       "w:35",
       0.4
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s11b13",
     "shot": "add_money",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "Then add money.",
     "date": null,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "coins",
       "w:money.",
       0.4
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s11b14",
     "shot": "prices",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "Prices rose 3.1 percent in the year to September,",
     "date": 2026,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "pop2",
       "w:3.1",
       0.4
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s11b15",
     "shot": "prices",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "up from 2.4 percent in August.",
     "date": 2026,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "pop2",
       "w:2.4",
       0.4
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s11b16",
     "shot": "prices",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "Diesel is around 2 euros 37 a litre.",
     "date": 2026,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "kaching",
       "w:€2.37",
       0.4
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s11b17",
     "shot": "prices",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "Reports tie the energy squeeze to the war in Iran.",
     "date": 2026,
     "sfx": []
    },
    {
     "id": "s11b18",
     "shot": "add_money",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "And then add the debt.",
     "date": null,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "thud",
       "w:debt.",
       0.5
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s11b19",
     "shot": "debt_gauge",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "France's public debt is about 119 percent of its entire economy,",
     "date": 2026,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "riser",
       2,
       0.3
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s11b20",
     "shot": "debt_gauge",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "roughly four trillion dollars, the highest ratio since the aftermath of World War Two.",
     "date": 2026,
     "sfx": []
    },
    {
     "id": "s11b21",
     "shot": "debt_gauge",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "The deficit is 5.4 percent of GDP, the 2027 budget aims for 5 percent,",
     "date": 2026,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "pop2",
       "w:5.4",
       0.4
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s11b22",
     "shot": "debt_gauge",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "and that means finding about 43 billion euros in savings.",
     "date": 2026,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "kaching",
       "w:43",
       0.4
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s11b23",
     "shot": "debt_gauge",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "Government borrowing costs hit their highest level in more than twenty years.",
     "date": 2026,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "riser",
       2,
       0.3
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s11b24",
     "shot": "debt_gauge",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "One projection says the interest bill alone could near 100 billion dollars a year by 2027.",
     "date": 2026,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "coins",
       6,
       0.4
      ],
      [
       "coins",
       20,
       0.4
      ],
      [
       "coins",
       34,
       0.4
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s11b25",
     "shot": "collision",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "Here's the collision.",
     "date": 2026,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "whoosh",
       2,
       0.4
      ],
      [
       "boom",
       26,
       0.5
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s11b26",
     "shot": "collision",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "Students and teachers are demanding more spending, at the exact moment a government that",
     "date": 2026,
     "sfx": []
    },
    {
     "id": "s11b27",
     "shot": "collision",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "has to cut spending is trying to pass a budget through a split parliament.",
     "date": 2026,
     "sfx": []
    },
    {
     "id": "s11b28",
     "shot": "merge",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "On 17 October, the school movement merged with a revived Yellow Vest network,",
     "date": 2026,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "whoosh",
       4,
       0.3
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s11b29",
     "shot": "merge",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "unions, retirees, farmers and climate campaigners into one national day of protest over the cost of living.",
     "date": 2026,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "whoosh",
       4,
       0.3
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s11b30",
     "shot": "turnout",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "The Interior Ministry counted about 550,000 people, around 110,000 of them in Paris.",
     "date": 2026,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "ticks",
       "w:550,000",
       0.4
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s11b31",
     "shot": "turnout",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "By Reuters' account, that was bigger than the Yellow Vests at their peak,",
     "date": 2026,
     "sfx": []
    },
    {
     "id": "s11b32",
     "shot": "turnout",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "and far smaller than the 2023 pension protests.",
     "date": 2026,
     "sfx": []
    },
    {
     "id": "s11b33",
     "shot": "peaceful",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "Most of them marched peacefully.",
     "date": 2026,
     "sfx": [],
     "amb": "birds"
    },
    {
     "id": "s11b34",
     "shot": "night_damage",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "But violent groups attacked town halls and police stations,",
     "date": 2026,
     "sfx": [],
     "quiet": true,
     "mood": "sombre"
    },
    {
     "id": "s11b35",
     "shot": "night_damage",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "set cars on fire and looted shops.",
     "date": 2026,
     "sfx": [],
     "quiet": true,
     "mood": "sombre"
    },
    {
     "id": "s11b36",
     "shot": "night_damage",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "The city hall in Limoges was burned.",
     "date": 2026,
     "sfx": [],
     "quiet": true,
     "mood": "sombre"
    },
    {
     "id": "s11b37",
     "shot": "prefect_callback",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "In Bordeaux, a masked crowd forced its way into the residence of the local prefect.",
     "date": 2026,
     "sfx": []
    },
    {
     "id": "s11b38",
     "shot": "prefect_callback",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "Yes, that prefect, the office Napoleon invented 226 years ago.",
     "date": 2026,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "stamp",
       "w:prefect,",
       0.5
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s11b39",
     "shot": "toll",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "The toll, as reported: nearly 1,800 arrests across the country,",
     "date": 2026,
     "sfx": [],
     "quiet": true,
     "mood": "sombre"
    },
    {
     "id": "s11b40",
     "shot": "toll",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "a record 855 in Paris, and more than 500 police officers injured.",
     "date": 2026,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "pop2",
       "w:injured.",
       0.3
      ]
     ],
     "quiet": true,
     "mood": "sombre"
    },
    {
     "id": "s11b41",
     "shot": "quiet_candle",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "One protester died after a cardiac arrest in Paris.",
     "date": 2026,
     "sfx": [],
     "quiet": true,
     "mood": "sombre"
    },
    {
     "id": "s11b42",
     "shot": "quiet_candle",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "The Interior Minister confirmed that another person lost a hand in clashes with police,",
     "date": 2026,
     "sfx": [],
     "quiet": true,
     "mood": "sombre"
    },
    {
     "id": "s11b43",
     "shot": "quiet_candle",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "and allegations of excessive force against young protesters are being scrutinised.",
     "date": 2026,
     "sfx": [],
     "quiet": true,
     "mood": "sombre"
    },
    {
     "id": "s11b44",
     "shot": "curfew",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "The response was curfews.",
     "date": 2026,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "ticks",
       4,
       0.3
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s11b45",
     "shot": "curfew",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "Overnight curfews in two areas of Paris, and curfews for under-18s in cities including Lille and Nice.",
     "date": 2026,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "ticks",
       4,
       0.3
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s11b46",
     "shot": "cooled",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "The government says the protests cooled afterwards, and another national day of protest is planned this weekend.",
     "date": 2026,
     "sfx": []
    },
    {
     "id": "s11b47",
     "shot": "cooled",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "Smaller protests over living costs have also appeared in Belgium, Portugal and Italy.",
     "date": 2026,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "pop2",
       "w:Belgium,",
       0.4
      ],
      [
       "pop2",
       "w:Portugal",
       0.4
      ],
      [
       "pop2",
       "w:Italy.",
       0.4
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s11b48",
     "shot": "moodys",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "And Moody's, the credit rating agency, was due to rule on France's debt rating on 23 October.",
     "date": 2026,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "drum",
       "w:23",
       0.4
      ],
